        <ul>
          <li><strong>Campaign Investment:</strong> $600 creator fee + $50 sample shipping = <strong>$650 Total Spend</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Performance:</strong> 48 sales tracked via promo code `SAVE15` @ $45.00 AOV</li>
          <li><strong>Total Revenue:</strong> 48 × $45.00 = <strong>$2,160.00</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Net Profit:</strong> $2,160.00 - $650.00 = <strong>+$1,510.00 Net Profit</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Campaign ROI:</strong> <code>(($2,160 - $650) / $650) × 100</code> = <strong>+232.31% ROI (High ROI)</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Customer Acquisition Cost:</strong> $650 / 48 = <strong>$13.54 per customer</strong></li>
