          <li><strong>Net Profit:</strong> $8,075.00 - $2,700.00 = <strong>+$5,375.00 Net Profit</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Campaign ROI:</strong> <code>(($8,075 - $2,700) / $2,700) × 100</code> = <strong>+199.07% ROI</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Customer Acquisition Cost:</strong> $2,700 / 85 = <strong>$31.76 per customer</strong></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="step-item">
        <h3>Scenario C: TikTok Viral Brand Awareness Campaign (Skincare & Beauty)</h3>
        <p><strong>Niche:</strong> Organic Sunscreen Launch | <strong>Format:</strong> 2 Short-form TikTok videos</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Campaign Investment:</strong> $1,200 creator fee + $300 Spark Ads boost = <strong>$1,500 Total Spend</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Performance:</strong> 85,000 video views, 4,200 likes/comments, 650 link clicks to product landing page</li>
          <li><strong>Earned Media Value:</strong> (85,000 × $0.015) + (4,200 × $0.15) + (650 × $1.00) = $1,275 + $630 + $650 = <strong>$2,555.00 EMV</strong></li>
